{title: Wadiyan Mera Daman}
{artist: Abhilasha Mohammed Rafi R D Burman}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C]Waadiya meraa daaman,
[G]raaste meri baahe
[F]Jaao mere sivaa,
[G]tum [C]kahaan jaaoge
[C]Jab [G]churaaoge tan
[F]tum kisi [C]baat se
[C]Shaakh e [G]gul chhed degi
[F]mere [C]haath se
[C]Apani hi [F]zulph ko
[G]aur [C]ulajhaaoge
[C]Jabase [G]milane lagi
[F]tumase [C]raahe meri
[C]Chaand [G]suraj bani
[F]do [C]nigaahe meri
[C]Tum kahi [F]bhi raho,
[G]tum [C]nazar aaoge
